Package: phoneblock-dongle
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, ca-certificates
Description: PhoneBlock Linux SIP spam-call blocker
 Shared PhoneBlock dongle firmware modules running as a native Linux service.
 Registers as a SIP endpoint, checks callers against PhoneBlock, and can
 stream a G.711 A-law announcement for spam calls.
